    "text": "Half mole of an ideal monoatomic gas is heated at a constant pressure of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>atm</mi></math> from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. Work done by the gas is<math><mo>(</mo></math>Gas constant,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8.21</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>)",
